WEBVTT

00:11.460 --> 00:13.540
[Rongcheng Group]

00:14.350 --> 00:16.810
This is the place
that vulgar man mentioned.

00:18.480 --> 00:20.120
I want to be a vulgar man too.

00:22.710 --> 00:23.800
Then we need to find

00:23.800 --> 00:25.260
that vulgar businessman,

00:25.760 --> 00:26.640
and get the money

00:26.640 --> 00:27.840
piled up in his house.

00:32.600 --> 00:33.710
Why don't we just search

00:33.710 --> 00:35.040
for his address online,

00:35.110 --> 00:36.710
like we did with that fat guy?

00:37.390 --> 00:39.110
That fat guy was showing off.

00:39.520 --> 00:40.390
When the reporter interviewed him,

00:40.390 --> 00:42.430
he insisted on
being filmed biking to work.

00:42.430 --> 00:44.030
That's how I found his house.

00:45.240 --> 00:46.150
But those big bosses

00:46.150 --> 00:47.410
are much more low-key.

00:48.110 --> 00:49.070
You can't find out

00:49.070 --> 00:50.330
where they live at all.

00:51.840 --> 00:52.600
Then why didn't we

00:52.600 --> 00:54.260
just follow him home that day?

00:54.430 --> 00:55.830
You have the nerve to ask?

00:56.350 --> 00:56.920
If you hadn't

00:56.920 --> 00:58.200
gone to pee in the woods,

00:58.200 --> 00:59.660
would he have gotten away?

01:04.120 --> 01:05.650
Can we still find his house?

01:07.680 --> 01:08.520
Why not?

01:08.950 --> 01:10.680
Who doesn't go home after work?

01:12.400 --> 01:13.560
That big boss has dinners

01:13.560 --> 01:14.600
every night.

01:16.280 --> 01:18.680
He still has to go home
after dinner, right?

01:18.950 --> 01:19.680
What if he goes for a bath

01:19.680 --> 01:20.690
after dinner?

01:23.280 --> 01:24.070
He still has to go home

01:24.070 --> 01:25.330
after his bath, right?

01:25.480 --> 01:27.250
Then it'll be dawn,

01:27.350 --> 01:29.010
and he'll go straight to work.

01:31.680 --> 01:32.280
Have you heard

01:32.280 --> 01:34.310
the story of Yu who removed the mountains?

01:34.310 --> 01:36.479
If he doesn't go home
and goes for a bath today,

01:36.479 --> 01:38.009
we'll follow him tomorrow.

01:38.200 --> 01:40.590
If he doesn't go home
and goes for a massage tomorrow,

01:40.590 --> 01:42.320
we'll follow him the day after.

01:42.509 --> 01:44.789
If he doesn't go home
and goes for a foot wash the day after,

01:44.789 --> 01:46.789
we'll follow him the day after that.

01:47.200 --> 01:49.130
Does he have that many activities?

01:49.200 --> 01:50.789
No matter how many activities he has,

01:50.789 --> 01:52.350
he has to go home eventually.

01:52.350 --> 01:54.080
We'll just keep following him.

01:54.150 --> 01:55.410
As long as he goes home,

01:56.400 --> 01:57.350
we can follow him to that place

01:57.350 --> 01:58.680
piled with money.

02:00.230 --> 02:00.870
Then...

03:24.320 --> 03:28.010
[Born with Luck]

03:28.120 --> 03:31.050
[Episode 8]

03:31.120 --> 03:32.800
Since you guys grew up together,

03:32.800 --> 03:34.000
whether it's true or not

03:34.000 --> 03:35.130
doesn't make sense.

03:37.910 --> 03:39.770
Why did you report Zhou Rong then?

03:40.470 --> 03:41.400
Because of love.

03:48.800 --> 03:49.870
Hello, Yibo.

03:50.000 --> 03:50.850
Hello, Qi.

03:51.280 --> 03:53.000
There's a new movie out recently.

03:53.000 --> 03:53.910
Do you want to go see it?

03:53.910 --> 03:54.710
I'm not going.

03:54.750 --> 03:55.750
Maybe another day.

03:55.750 --> 03:56.880
I'm too tired today.

04:01.360 --> 04:02.690
Then get some good rest.

04:30.920 --> 04:32.470
You suspected

04:32.800 --> 04:35.200
Zhou Rong and Zhou Qi
were having an affair,

04:35.510 --> 04:37.310
so you wrote this report letter?

04:40.120 --> 04:43.070
[report letter]

04:42.870 --> 04:44.730
I treated you like a good brother,

04:45.159 --> 04:47.000
and you stab me in the back?

04:48.680 --> 04:49.480
This is too much.

04:48.710 --> 04:52.330
[report letter]

04:50.070 --> 04:51.000
This is too much.

04:52.600 --> 04:54.000
Then nobody gets to live.

04:54.240 --> 04:55.500
Nobody gets out alive.

04:55.920 --> 04:57.320
Then nobody gets to live!

05:06.950 --> 05:08.150
I am a police officer.

05:08.390 --> 05:09.360
Don't run to this area!

05:09.360 --> 05:10.560
It's dangerous here!

05:10.720 --> 05:11.710
I am a cop!

05:20.530 --> 05:22.440
[I hereby report this under my real name.]

05:20.600 --> 05:21.480
The name is

05:21.630 --> 05:22.430
unavailable.

05:22.900 --> 05:24.160
The last digits of the ID number

05:24.160 --> 05:24.600
match;

05:24.630 --> 05:26.430
the leading digits are missing.

05:30.070 --> 05:30.800
Chief Zhang,

05:31.040 --> 05:31.700
it matches.

05:35.030 --> 05:36.490
If it matches, it's right.

05:37.040 --> 05:38.700
If only I hadn't sent it out,

05:38.920 --> 05:41.050
none of this crap would have happened.

05:47.870 --> 05:49.740
So it's because his girlfriend

05:50.120 --> 05:52.450
was having an affair with his best friend.

05:54.190 --> 05:55.270
I'm not gossiping.

05:55.360 --> 05:57.020
I just want to figure this out.

05:57.120 --> 05:57.920
It's my fault.

05:58.390 --> 06:00.050
It's all a misunderstanding.

06:01.040 --> 06:02.600
Mr. Rong is so successful in business,

06:02.600 --> 06:03.380
handsome,

06:03.750 --> 06:04.450
and single.

06:05.630 --> 06:07.430
No surprise he's a bit of a flirt.

06:07.720 --> 06:09.520
People are bound to misread him.

06:11.770 --> 06:13.150
[My only love, Qi—
I hurriedly leave, just as I…]

06:12.510 --> 06:13.040
Qi,

06:13.170 --> 06:15.150
[Gently I came; in haste we met,
and in haste we part.]

06:13.560 --> 06:15.190
none of this has anything to do with you.

06:15.190 --> 06:16.990
I'll leave all my savings to you.

06:17.430 --> 06:19.160
The password is your birthday.

06:44.050 --> 06:48.320
[Mr. Rong]

06:53.330 --> 06:55.480
[Mr. Rong]

07:03.450 --> 07:05.380
[Mr. Rong]

07:10.240 --> 07:10.770
Hello?

07:10.800 --> 07:11.200
Hello?

07:11.920 --> 07:13.380
Fire that Shanshan for me.

07:13.430 --> 07:14.090
I never want

07:14.120 --> 07:15.510
to see her at Fenglinwan again.

07:15.510 --> 07:16.090
Who?

07:16.430 --> 07:18.290
Shanshan from the PR department,

07:18.360 --> 07:20.760
the one who lives in
the same building as Qi.

07:21.310 --> 07:22.240
What do you mean?

07:22.390 --> 07:24.190
That girl went on a date
with me last night,

07:24.190 --> 07:25.680
and she ate fried leek dumplings.

07:25.680 --> 07:26.510
But the whole world knows

07:26.510 --> 07:27.870
I can't stand the smell of leeks.

07:27.870 --> 07:28.560
My mouth

07:28.560 --> 07:29.960
still tastes like leeks.

07:31.120 --> 07:31.760
Mr. Rong,

07:33.120 --> 07:35.240
you were on a date
with Shanshan last night?

07:35.240 --> 07:35.770
Who else?

07:51.190 --> 07:52.120
Just because

07:53.040 --> 07:53.680
of this?

07:54.950 --> 07:55.360
Yes.

07:56.310 --> 07:57.840
Maybe you won't believe it,

07:58.270 --> 08:00.200
but I really can't live without Qi.

08:01.830 --> 08:03.270
Only she can make me feel

08:05.190 --> 08:06.320
the dignity of a man.

08:07.360 --> 08:08.030
And then?

08:08.870 --> 08:09.800
Couldn't you just cancel

08:09.800 --> 08:10.600
the delivery?

08:11.240 --> 08:11.680
At first,

08:11.680 --> 08:12.940
that's what I thought.

08:13.510 --> 08:13.950
But...

08:23.630 --> 08:25.980
Welcome to Jiangcheng Express.

08:26.070 --> 08:28.990
Safe, fast, and reliable—

08:29.120 --> 08:30.970
that's our promise to you.

08:31.430 --> 08:33.289
For faster shipping

08:33.390 --> 08:34.330
and tracking,

08:34.600 --> 08:36.600
please visit our official website.

08:43.049 --> 08:44.930
For shipping, press 1.

08:45.750 --> 08:47.990
For tracking, press 2.

08:48.550 --> 08:51.160
For customer service, press 3.

08:51.870 --> 08:52.270
Hello.

08:52.270 --> 08:53.820
How can I help you?

08:55.000 --> 08:55.570
Hello?

08:55.750 --> 08:57.280
I sent a package by mistake.

08:57.960 --> 08:59.630
I need to get it back right away.

08:59.630 --> 09:00.390
Bring your ID

09:00.440 --> 09:01.030
to our station,

09:01.030 --> 09:01.960
explain the situation,

09:01.960 --> 09:02.630
and once verified,

09:02.630 --> 09:03.870
-you can get your parcel back.
-I…

09:03.870 --> 09:04.650
I'm at

09:05.200 --> 09:06.750
Yiyuan Haoting residential community.

09:06.750 --> 09:07.450
Where is

09:07.750 --> 09:08.620
your express

09:09.000 --> 09:09.530
station?

09:10.240 --> 09:11.150
Hurry up, okay?

09:11.870 --> 09:12.600
Please wait a moment, sir.

09:12.600 --> 09:13.800
I'll check it for you.

09:27.440 --> 09:28.030
So

09:28.550 --> 09:31.120
the report letter
went to the provincial capital.

09:31.120 --> 09:32.430
You chased it to the provincial capital

09:32.430 --> 09:34.090
to get the report letter back.

09:35.650 --> 09:36.320
Your package

09:36.320 --> 09:37.870
is already out for delivery.

09:37.870 --> 09:38.600
Don't worry.

09:38.670 --> 09:40.130
I have the package with me.

09:40.440 --> 09:41.670
You can bring your ID to find me,

09:41.670 --> 09:42.840
or wait at the station.

09:42.840 --> 09:43.510
No need.

09:43.600 --> 09:44.200
I'll go to you.

09:44.200 --> 09:45.000
I'll go to you.

09:45.590 --> 09:47.420
[Name: Lu Yibo]

09:45.670 --> 09:46.550
Is it you?

09:46.550 --> 09:47.320
On behalf of the organizers

09:47.320 --> 09:48.360
and the staff of today's event,

09:48.360 --> 09:50.020
I would like to warmly welcome

09:50.210 --> 09:51.970
all the guests present here.

09:52.000 --> 09:52.320
Great!

09:52.320 --> 09:53.320
Eight!

09:53.390 --> 09:54.270
Seven!

09:54.440 --> 09:55.440
Six!

09:55.480 --> 09:56.240
Five!

09:56.720 --> 09:57.510
Four!

09:57.840 --> 09:58.750
Three!

09:59.080 --> 09:59.910
Two!

10:00.120 --> 10:01.600
One.

10:06.200 --> 10:07.240
Believe it or not,

10:07.630 --> 10:08.890
I'm telling the truth.

10:09.440 --> 10:10.600
I can swear to God.

10:11.120 --> 10:12.480
Then why did you write
in the report letter

10:12.480 --> 10:14.120
that he was related to

10:14.200 --> 10:15.360
Lu Zheng's death?

10:15.510 --> 10:17.040
Because when Lu Zheng died,

10:18.200 --> 10:19.200
I acted on impulse

10:19.390 --> 10:20.550
and wanted to frame him

10:20.550 --> 10:21.360
with a felony.

10:22.320 --> 10:23.510
But the case

10:23.630 --> 10:25.270
had already been officially settled.

10:25.270 --> 10:26.270
That's why I wrote the report letter

10:26.270 --> 10:27.400
to you, Chief Zhang.

10:27.480 --> 10:29.210
Everyone in Sanjiangkou knows

10:29.440 --> 10:30.750
when Chief Lu had his accident,

10:30.750 --> 10:31.440
you said,

10:32.270 --> 10:34.000
we should doubt our doubts.

10:38.840 --> 10:39.750
Your...

10:39.790 --> 10:40.840
According to what you're saying now,

10:40.840 --> 10:43.100
you and Zhou Rong are childhood friends,

10:43.390 --> 10:45.360
you wrote a report letter against him,

10:45.360 --> 10:46.600
and the letter contains

10:46.600 --> 10:48.000
some fatal accusations.

10:48.510 --> 10:49.270
Now you're telling me

10:49.270 --> 10:50.200
none of these are true

10:50.200 --> 10:51.720
and it's a misunderstanding.

10:51.720 --> 10:53.780
This hardly dispels our suspicions.

10:55.230 --> 10:57.160
It's also out of envy and jealousy.

10:57.790 --> 10:58.150
Yes.

10:58.480 --> 10:59.550
We are childhood friends.

10:59.550 --> 11:00.150
Mr. Rong,

11:00.750 --> 11:01.270
Ye,

11:01.750 --> 11:02.270
Bowen,

11:02.670 --> 11:03.200
and I.

11:07.080 --> 11:08.480
But I actually hate them.

11:08.840 --> 11:09.770
What do you mean?

11:10.390 --> 11:11.720
Not to mention Mr. Rong.

11:12.120 --> 11:13.980
He's the boss of Rongcheng Group,

11:14.080 --> 11:15.720
a famous entrepreneur in Sanjiangkou.

11:15.720 --> 11:16.650
It should be him.

11:16.910 --> 11:18.480
Bowen is doing well these years.

11:18.480 --> 11:19.940
He's making a lot of money.

11:20.080 --> 11:21.910
Before Ye died, he was the captain

11:21.910 --> 11:23.150
of Sanjiangkou CID.

11:23.550 --> 11:24.910
He had a successful career

11:24.910 --> 11:26.000
and power.

11:26.200 --> 11:27.440
Who takes me seriously?

11:27.440 --> 11:28.390
Aren't you a somebody?

11:28.390 --> 11:28.850
Wait,

11:28.960 --> 11:30.510
I'm just saying at least you are

11:30.510 --> 11:32.000
the general manager
of Fenglinwan Hotel.

11:32.000 --> 11:33.330
You have a big business.

11:34.240 --> 11:35.640
You only see the surface.

11:36.000 --> 11:37.200
I'm just an employee.

11:38.720 --> 11:41.120
Fenglinwan Hotel was invested by Mr. Rong.

11:41.120 --> 11:42.720
I'm just his legal representative

11:42.720 --> 11:44.000
earning a fixed salary.

11:44.000 --> 11:46.500
You are the legal representative
of his company?

11:46.500 --> 11:48.030
This is not illegal, right?

11:48.210 --> 11:50.010
Then according to what you said,

11:50.870 --> 11:53.600
you also hold a grudge against
Ye Jian, don't you?

11:54.510 --> 11:55.570
I hate myself more.

12:02.080 --> 12:03.150
I'll tell you something

12:03.150 --> 12:04.390
that I shouldn't.

12:05.960 --> 12:07.690
The night Ye Jian was murdered,

12:07.720 --> 12:08.910
he used his last ounce of strength

12:08.910 --> 12:10.370
to write down three words.

12:10.910 --> 12:11.720
It's a name.

12:13.670 --> 12:15.270
There's a "Yi" in the middle.

12:17.150 --> 12:17.840
Chief Zhang,

12:17.840 --> 12:18.750
don't scare me.

12:20.270 --> 12:20.790
Ye

12:21.120 --> 12:22.880
couldn't have written my name.

12:23.910 --> 12:25.170
It doesn't make sense.

12:28.600 --> 12:30.080
You know enough already.

12:30.910 --> 12:31.840
One last question for you.

12:31.840 --> 12:32.970
Answer truthfully.

12:33.150 --> 12:33.680
Go ahead.

12:34.120 --> 12:35.360
The night Ye Jian was murdered,

12:35.360 --> 12:37.160
did he come to Fenglinwan Hotel?

12:37.270 --> 12:38.870
Fenglinwan is an entertainment venue.

12:38.870 --> 12:39.910
To avoid suspicion,

12:39.910 --> 12:43.110
-he didn't even come to the opening.
-Answer my question.

12:44.840 --> 12:45.390
No.

12:59.320 --> 13:00.480
Lu Yibo

13:00.510 --> 13:02.570
is definitely not telling the truth.

13:04.550 --> 13:05.600
But he didn't look like

13:05.600 --> 13:06.550
he was lying.

13:08.360 --> 13:09.090
Chief Zhang,

13:09.720 --> 13:11.210
how about we find some time

13:11.550 --> 13:14.410
to invite Zhou Rong
to the station for questioning?

13:15.670 --> 13:17.600
Lu Yibo only admitted

13:17.630 --> 13:19.960
that the person he reported was Zhou Rong.

13:20.550 --> 13:22.790
Now he says he was smearing Zhou Rong.

13:23.080 --> 13:25.000
He also took the report letter back.

13:25.000 --> 13:26.130
We have no evidence.

13:26.840 --> 13:28.500
Calling Zhou Rong in like this

13:29.080 --> 13:30.340
would just tip him off.

13:35.240 --> 13:36.360
Could Zhou Rong already know

13:36.360 --> 13:38.600
about Lu Yibo writing the report letter?

13:38.600 --> 13:39.750
Definitely not.

13:40.200 --> 13:41.460
Think about it, Chief.

13:41.510 --> 13:42.690
If Zhou Rong knew

13:42.720 --> 13:43.920
Lu Yibo reported him,

13:44.270 --> 13:45.600
he would skin him alive.

13:46.150 --> 13:47.030
Could he still sit there

13:47.030 --> 13:47.830
drinking tea?

13:48.510 --> 13:49.320
We finally

13:49.320 --> 13:50.580
found a breakthrough.

13:50.840 --> 13:52.300
And now it's closed again.

14:00.750 --> 14:01.480
Chief Zhang.

14:01.910 --> 14:02.700
Wang.

14:02.910 --> 14:04.390
Good evening, officers.

14:10.200 --> 14:11.060
Let's go, Wang.

14:12.240 --> 14:13.940
No, maybe she's just

14:14.120 --> 14:15.770
being polite.

14:33.390 --> 14:34.510
Before we came,

14:34.670 --> 14:35.610
didn't you say

14:35.910 --> 14:36.750
that the night gave you

14:36.750 --> 14:37.720
dark eyes?

14:38.200 --> 14:40.130
But I use them to look for the light.

14:40.440 --> 14:41.670
So where is the light?

14:42.670 --> 14:44.330
Lu Yibo insists on denying it.

14:44.510 --> 14:46.480
The report letter
doesn't constitute evidence.

14:46.480 --> 14:47.990
Ye has never been to Fenglinwan Hotel.

14:47.990 --> 14:48.720
Chief Zhang,

14:48.750 --> 14:50.280
how do we investigate this?

14:53.910 --> 14:55.470
Keep moving forward,

14:56.670 --> 14:58.870
constantly pursuing that golden hope.

15:08.320 --> 15:09.790
I still think

15:10.630 --> 15:12.240
that Lu Yibo's report letter

15:12.270 --> 15:14.130
appearing at the explosion scene

15:14.240 --> 15:15.840
is too much of a coincidence.

15:16.370 --> 15:21.400
♪ Doubt ♪

15:18.720 --> 15:20.910
It can't be a coincidence

15:20.960 --> 15:21.790
that this report letter was found

15:21.790 --> 15:23.120
at the explosion scene.

15:24.150 --> 15:29.620
♪ Doubt ♪

15:26.550 --> 15:27.550
Is it possible

15:29.100 --> 15:30.600
that someone wanted to
stop Lu Yibo from delivering the letter,

15:30.600 --> 15:32.060
even trying to blow him up?

15:32.710 --> 15:47.920
Doubt, Doubt, Doubt

15:34.550 --> 15:38.080
We need to check the files
on the provincial capital explosion.

15:38.390 --> 15:39.480
These two incidents

15:39.480 --> 15:40.480
shouldn't be connected, right?

15:40.480 --> 15:43.480
Check the files
on the provincial capital explosion.

15:47.840 --> 15:49.790
Mr. Rong, are you still mad at me?

15:56.240 --> 15:57.480
Are you done?

15:57.630 --> 15:59.490
Mr. Rong doesn't want to kill you.

15:59.790 --> 16:00.590
Ren,

16:01.200 --> 16:02.360
stop joking around.

16:03.550 --> 16:05.480
We are driving out of Sanjiangkou.

16:06.750 --> 16:07.360
Can you find

16:07.360 --> 16:08.390
a nice and scenic place

16:08.390 --> 16:09.450
before you kill me?

16:16.910 --> 16:18.110
To tell you the truth:

16:18.870 --> 16:20.030
Mr. Rong wants to give you

16:20.030 --> 16:22.090
a chance to make up for your mistakes.

16:22.550 --> 16:23.880
What do you want me to do?

16:25.990 --> 16:27.840
Do you know anything about music?

16:27.840 --> 16:28.900
What kind of music?

16:29.440 --> 16:30.150
Percussion

16:30.510 --> 16:31.440
with drumbeats.

16:35.200 --> 16:35.790
Mr. Lang!

16:36.790 --> 16:37.360
Mr. Lang,

16:38.170 --> 16:39.360
you walk so fast.

16:39.390 --> 16:40.990
I had a hard time catching up.

16:41.270 --> 16:42.070
This is...

16:42.480 --> 16:43.600
This is your...

16:44.150 --> 16:44.630
My what?

16:46.840 --> 16:47.970
Bill for this month.

16:52.600 --> 16:53.600
So I have to pay

16:53.630 --> 16:55.630
when I come to Fenglinwan Hotel now?

16:55.630 --> 16:56.720
No, Mr. Lang.

16:57.790 --> 16:59.480
The store has been losing money.

16:59.480 --> 17:00.480
This is a new rule.

17:00.870 --> 17:02.190
Just sign it for me.

17:02.270 --> 17:03.260
Where is Lu Yibo?

17:03.840 --> 17:04.510
Mr. Lu?

17:05.589 --> 17:06.770
I haven't seen him. I don't know.

17:06.770 --> 17:07.460
Call him.

17:07.510 --> 17:08.839
Let him tell me himself.

17:09.160 --> 17:10.400
Mr. Lang,

17:10.589 --> 17:12.720
please don't make it difficult for me.

17:13.200 --> 17:13.810
Qi.

17:13.920 --> 17:15.650
Ask her if you don't believe me.

17:16.900 --> 17:17.500
Come here.

17:19.550 --> 17:21.220
Mr. Lang, what's wrong?

17:21.480 --> 17:22.140
Let's chat.

17:22.250 --> 17:23.150
Let's chat.

17:23.550 --> 17:24.609
Let me see the bill.

17:25.069 --> 17:25.510
Okay.

17:26.880 --> 17:28.230
How could you not know

17:28.750 --> 17:29.810
where Lu Yibo went?

17:29.920 --> 17:30.590
Officer,

17:31.160 --> 17:32.210
Yibo is a guy

17:32.240 --> 17:34.040
who really likes to play around.

17:34.070 --> 17:34.870
He plays games

17:35.200 --> 17:36.200
and goes fishing.

17:36.270 --> 17:37.400
When he's having fun,

17:37.400 --> 17:38.750
it's common for him to disappear

17:38.750 --> 17:40.110
for two or three days.

17:41.310 --> 17:43.510
You can't reach him for a couple of days.

17:44.920 --> 17:45.580
Don't move.

17:45.680 --> 17:46.960
Just sign it.

17:48.200 --> 17:49.350
If you can contact him,

17:49.350 --> 17:50.690
tell him we came looking for him.

17:50.690 --> 17:51.510
There are still a few details

17:51.510 --> 17:54.240
about the provincial capital case
we need to confirm with him.

17:54.240 --> 17:55.250
Okay, officer.

17:55.370 --> 17:56.830
We won't bother you anymore.

17:56.830 --> 17:57.960
Take care, officer.

18:06.640 --> 18:08.290
Hello. The number you have dialed

18:08.290 --> 18:09.450
-is powered off.
-Qi.

18:09.450 --> 18:11.560
Sorry, the subscriber you dialed

18:11.590 --> 18:12.450
is powered off.

18:12.510 --> 18:13.200
Wen?

18:23.590 --> 18:24.590
Why are the police

18:24.790 --> 18:25.880
looking for Yibo?

18:28.400 --> 18:28.970
Yibo and I

18:29.000 --> 18:30.660
grew up together as brothers.

18:31.240 --> 18:33.240
Is there anything you can't tell me?

18:34.720 --> 18:35.380
Wen,

18:36.960 --> 18:37.750
tell me,

18:38.550 --> 18:39.590
if Yibo did something

18:39.590 --> 18:40.920
to let Mr. Rong down,

18:42.070 --> 18:44.000
but he truly realized his mistake,

18:44.200 --> 18:45.730
would Mr. Rong forgive him?

18:48.100 --> 18:49.430
What do you mean by that?

18:51.510 --> 18:52.770
I don't know anything.

18:55.590 --> 18:56.070
Tell me

18:57.000 --> 18:58.270
what exactly Yibo did?

18:59.270 --> 19:00.800
How did he let Mr. Rong down?

19:12.680 --> 19:14.080
This is your last chance.

19:15.110 --> 19:16.040
If you mess it up,

19:16.350 --> 19:17.400
I will really find you

19:17.400 --> 19:19.070
a picturesque place to bury you.

19:19.070 --> 19:19.730
Don't, bro.

19:23.550 --> 19:24.170
Go.

19:24.590 --> 19:25.510
Before the matter is done,

19:25.510 --> 19:26.770
don't contact anyone.

19:28.110 --> 19:29.110
Is it that simple?

19:31.000 --> 19:32.000
It is that simple.

19:44.240 --> 19:44.880
Ren,

19:45.200 --> 19:45.790
what's Zhu Yifei's background

19:45.790 --> 19:46.820
anyway?

19:46.880 --> 19:48.070
Am I in any danger?

19:48.960 --> 19:49.780
Ren!

19:50.160 --> 19:50.870
Ren!

20:07.070 --> 20:07.930
Is anyone here?

20:12.200 --> 20:13.060
Is anyone here?

20:15.440 --> 20:16.920
Only the dog is home.

20:18.720 --> 20:19.680
Who are you looking for?

20:19.680 --> 20:20.160
Hello,

20:21.110 --> 20:23.440
I'm from Rongcheng Group
in Sanjiangkou.

20:23.590 --> 20:24.240
No, no, no.

20:24.750 --> 20:26.240
I'm here to buy something from Uncle Fei.

20:26.240 --> 20:27.200
Ren arranged it.

20:42.940 --> 20:45.480
[Huo Zheng — Zhu Yifei's subordinate]

20:44.880 --> 20:45.810
Is it turned off?

20:46.240 --> 20:47.830
I turned it off on the way here.

20:47.830 --> 20:49.280
Don't mind it, brother.

20:50.680 --> 20:52.410
It's just the rules of the game.

21:00.400 --> 21:01.630
Wait here.

21:28.510 --> 21:29.070
Sir.

21:31.000 --> 21:31.520
Sir.

21:32.200 --> 21:33.320
Excuse me,

21:33.830 --> 21:35.680
do they sell chimes here?

21:41.310 --> 21:41.910
Uncle Fei.

21:43.240 --> 21:43.930
Fish food.

21:44.680 --> 21:46.010
Are you Zhu Yifei?

21:46.550 --> 21:47.550
Yes.

21:46.870 --> 21:49.820
[Huo Zheng — Zhu Yifei's subordinate]

21:49.160 --> 21:49.890
But we are

21:49.920 --> 21:51.380
legitimate businessmen.

21:55.160 --> 21:56.350
The goods you want

21:57.400 --> 21:58.460
are not available.

21:59.750 --> 22:01.880
Sorry for making you come for nothing.

22:07.540 --> 22:09.740
Brother, please give me the phone back.

22:10.030 --> 22:10.920
It's mealtime.

22:11.960 --> 22:13.160
Let's eat together.

22:13.440 --> 22:14.790
I'll pass on the meal.

22:18.440 --> 22:20.900
Business may fail, but friendship remains.

22:21.030 --> 22:22.750
If I don't invite you to stay for a meal,

22:22.750 --> 22:23.750
and word gets out,

22:25.310 --> 22:27.000
they'll say I have no manners.

22:37.590 --> 22:38.030
Hello?

22:38.440 --> 22:39.590
Did you see the goods?

22:39.590 --> 22:40.110
No.

22:41.000 --> 22:42.600
Then why are you still there?

22:44.200 --> 22:46.110
Boss Zhu invited me to eat.

22:47.000 --> 22:47.690
How about

22:47.880 --> 22:49.480
you come here yourself, Ren?

22:52.070 --> 22:52.550
Ren?

22:54.720 --> 22:55.440
Eat, Yibo.

22:56.400 --> 22:57.790
It was Mr. Rong who gave you the chance

22:57.790 --> 22:59.050
to negotiate the deal.

23:04.960 --> 23:06.020
Turn off the phone.

23:08.550 --> 23:09.410
Hello, it's me.

23:09.550 --> 23:10.210
Hu Jianren,

23:10.830 --> 23:12.160
is Zhu Yifei reliable?

23:14.350 --> 23:15.350
I know he hasn't failed

23:15.350 --> 23:16.480
all these years.

23:17.160 --> 23:18.400
It's just that if the deal falls through,

23:18.400 --> 23:19.590
no one gets out.

23:20.590 --> 23:21.640
But I just want to know

23:21.640 --> 23:23.400
if he has the goods right now.

23:29.910 --> 23:30.390
Uncle,

23:31.070 --> 23:33.440
it's been a long time.

23:34.400 --> 23:35.730
It should be about time.

23:36.550 --> 23:39.750
Now is the perfect time
to simmer the soup.

23:40.720 --> 23:42.130
Since they are here,

23:42.830 --> 23:44.630
they can't leave empty-handed.

23:44.720 --> 23:46.350
What if they only want the chime bells

23:46.350 --> 23:47.350
and nothing else?

23:48.880 --> 23:50.120
Then for the next pot,

23:50.640 --> 23:52.300
we'll simmer them.

24:04.440 --> 24:06.900
Black tiger palm mushroom
and chicken soup.

24:07.160 --> 24:07.820
Have a taste

24:08.310 --> 24:09.170
while it's hot.

24:19.750 --> 24:20.750
That's the taste.

24:22.680 --> 24:23.780
To be honest,

24:24.960 --> 24:26.960
it's my first time eating tiger paw.

24:28.030 --> 24:29.690
Whether it's the right taste,

24:30.030 --> 24:30.760
I don't know.

24:31.790 --> 24:33.320
But it's a really good soup.

24:40.510 --> 24:41.640
Tigers

24:41.640 --> 24:43.040
are national treasures.

24:43.350 --> 24:44.820
Do you really think

24:44.960 --> 24:45.750
I'd chop off a tiger's paw

24:45.750 --> 24:46.880
just to make soup

24:47.070 --> 24:47.970
for you?

24:48.310 --> 24:49.910
I'd rather stew you instead.

24:54.000 --> 24:54.920
Just kidding.

24:56.110 --> 24:57.510
This is a kind of mushroom

24:58.680 --> 25:00.010
called Black Tiger Paw.

25:01.270 --> 25:02.000
Understand?

25:04.480 --> 25:05.550
Then this is just

25:06.510 --> 25:08.510
ch- chicken stewed with mushrooms?

25:08.550 --> 25:09.410
Let me tell you,

25:09.880 --> 25:10.920
this kind of fungus

25:10.920 --> 25:12.250
is extremely precious.

25:12.750 --> 25:13.440
Its price

25:13.590 --> 25:15.540
isn't necessarily cheaper

25:15.680 --> 25:16.640
than a real tiger paw.

25:16.640 --> 25:17.970
But the soup made from it

25:18.350 --> 25:20.200
is even more delicious
than a real tiger paw.

25:20.200 --> 25:20.930
Try it again.

25:28.830 --> 25:29.650
Young man.

25:30.110 --> 25:32.040
There are some things in this world

25:32.470 --> 25:33.680
that you can't force.

25:34.830 --> 25:36.480
There is always a substitute.

25:36.480 --> 25:36.920
Right?

25:38.310 --> 25:38.790
Yes.

26:18.070 --> 26:18.670
Thank you.

26:19.790 --> 26:20.250
Well...

26:20.310 --> 26:21.370
What are you doing?

26:22.720 --> 26:24.240
This...

26:24.790 --> 26:25.880
Wh- What's wrong?

26:31.590 --> 26:33.440
What's wrong, young man?

26:34.830 --> 26:36.400
Do you know what this is?

26:38.920 --> 26:40.070
Ru kiln porcelain.

26:41.930 --> 26:43.090
Ru kiln porcelain?

26:44.550 --> 26:46.150
It was from the Song Dynasty.

26:46.880 --> 26:48.480
Only 67 pieces have survived

26:49.350 --> 26:51.510
in the entire world to this day.

26:52.310 --> 26:53.400
And you actually

26:53.480 --> 26:55.270
spit bones into it.

26:56.440 --> 26:59.440
Are you going to sell this to Mr. Rong?

27:02.510 --> 27:04.030
Is this one of those

27:04.160 --> 27:04.760
67 pieces?

27:05.400 --> 27:06.110
This is

27:06.920 --> 27:08.230
the 68th piece.

27:09.110 --> 27:10.310
Not long ago,

27:10.350 --> 27:11.750
a friend of mine

27:12.590 --> 27:14.590
salvaged a sunken ship
from the Song Dynasty

27:14.590 --> 27:17.550
in the Indian Ocean.

27:18.200 --> 27:19.240
This item

27:20.110 --> 27:21.750
was found in the ship.

27:23.720 --> 27:25.540
[Ping'an Province
Antique Appraisal Center.]

27:24.200 --> 27:27.060
It's the appraisal certificate
issued by experts.

27:28.980 --> 27:31.370
[Provenance: Northern Song Dynasty]

27:37.030 --> 27:37.590
Mr. Rong.

27:38.920 --> 27:39.450
Mr. Rong.

27:40.440 --> 27:42.300
Lu Yibo is still waiting for news.

27:42.310 --> 27:43.790
I don't care whether it's a set of chimes

27:43.790 --> 27:44.780
or a plate,

27:45.680 --> 27:47.410
or whether it's iron or bronze.

27:48.680 --> 27:49.820
Your only goal

27:50.750 --> 27:52.080
is to satisfy Fang Yong.

27:53.270 --> 27:54.480
Understood.

28:04.790 --> 28:07.400
[Alarm clock][5 minutes]

28:13.790 --> 28:14.320
Mr. Fang.

28:17.720 --> 28:18.650
Why are you here?

28:20.960 --> 28:22.090
The stuff you wanted

28:22.440 --> 28:23.030
is ready.

28:25.160 --> 28:26.720
Mr. Zhou asked me to come over

28:26.720 --> 28:27.910
to get you a rack.

28:28.110 --> 28:28.880
Otherwise, there will be

28:28.880 --> 28:29.960
nowhere to put it.

28:30.350 --> 28:31.410
So he told me to come

28:31.550 --> 28:33.080
and take the measurements.

28:33.560 --> 28:34.020
Come in.

28:34.270 --> 28:34.680
Okay.

28:39.400 --> 28:40.110
Look,

28:40.400 --> 28:42.060
where should we put the stuff?

28:53.440 --> 28:54.100
Right here.

28:54.510 --> 28:55.170
Put it here.

28:55.480 --> 28:56.010
Alright.

29:07.270 --> 29:08.040
Mr. Fang,

29:08.790 --> 29:10.400
can we make this shelf

29:10.440 --> 29:11.900
out of chicken-wing wood?

29:12.750 --> 29:14.280
I'd prefer Phoebe zhennan.

29:14.960 --> 29:16.400
We don't have Phoebe zhennan.

29:16.400 --> 29:17.600
Is old rosewood okay?

29:18.480 --> 29:19.410
Red sandalwood.

29:19.720 --> 29:21.160
Red sandalwood at the very least.

29:21.160 --> 29:21.640
Okay.

29:21.790 --> 29:23.250
Then red sandalwood it is.

29:34.440 --> 29:35.500
What are you doing?

29:37.440 --> 29:38.480
Measuring the windows.

29:38.480 --> 29:39.810
Measuring the windows?

29:39.830 --> 29:41.030
Getting the dimensions of the windows

29:41.030 --> 29:43.160
so I can order reflective film for you.

29:43.590 --> 29:45.170
Reflective film?

29:45.590 --> 29:47.480
If we don't put up reflective film,

29:47.480 --> 29:50.010
people outside
might be able to see inside.

29:50.550 --> 29:51.760
If they see

29:51.790 --> 29:53.310
these antiques, that's one thing.

29:53.310 --> 29:55.500
You could just say
they're family heirlooms,

29:55.500 --> 29:57.070
and no one could say anything.

29:57.070 --> 29:58.640
But if they see

29:58.920 --> 30:00.420
Han Dynasty bronze chimes

30:00.510 --> 30:02.570
hanging on this red sandalwood rack,

30:02.720 --> 30:03.930
and report you,

30:04.070 --> 30:05.470
how would you explain it?

30:08.350 --> 30:09.150
And over here.

30:15.510 --> 30:16.790
If it were up to me,

30:17.720 --> 30:18.790
outside here,

30:19.000 --> 30:20.720
I'd add another security door.

30:20.720 --> 30:22.160
When someone comes to the door,

30:22.160 --> 30:23.620
you close this door first,

30:23.640 --> 30:25.070
before opening the outer door.

30:25.070 --> 30:25.790
That way, the people outside

30:25.790 --> 30:27.310
won't be able to see inside.

30:27.310 --> 30:28.330
The way it is now,

30:28.590 --> 30:29.680
when a delivery guy comes,

30:29.680 --> 30:30.480
they can see

30:30.510 --> 30:31.880
the chimes inside at a glance.

30:31.880 --> 30:33.120
If someone sees it,

30:33.400 --> 30:34.460
it'd be a huge deal.

30:34.920 --> 30:36.330
You'd be doomed.

30:37.240 --> 30:37.750
Also...

30:38.920 --> 30:40.380
Sorry, I need to take this.

30:42.130 --> 30:42.960
[Alarm clock]

30:43.210 --> 30:44.530
[Alarm clock]

30:46.510 --> 30:47.000
Hello?

30:49.590 --> 30:51.850
We don't want that Ru kiln plate anymore.

30:52.270 --> 30:54.330
My friend chose the chimes in the end.

30:56.110 --> 30:56.880
Okay, thanks.

30:56.880 --> 30:57.210
Okay.

30:59.240 --> 30:59.840
By the way,

30:59.880 --> 31:00.400
our...

31:00.440 --> 31:00.880
No.

31:01.000 --> 31:02.270
Do you want the black film
or the silver one?

31:02.270 --> 31:02.680
What?

31:03.000 --> 31:05.180
Did you just say

31:05.270 --> 31:06.510
a Ru kiln plate?

31:08.160 --> 31:09.440
What Ru kiln plate?

31:12.240 --> 31:13.590
A friend of mine abroad

31:14.110 --> 31:15.210
just salvaged

31:15.240 --> 31:16.230
a Northern Song sunken ship

31:16.230 --> 31:17.490
from the Indian Ocean.

31:17.960 --> 31:19.800
The ship is full of porcelain.

31:20.110 --> 31:21.310
The most amazing part

31:21.350 --> 31:22.610
is that there's a large

31:23.030 --> 31:24.440
Ru kiln plate.

31:24.830 --> 31:26.440
A Ru kiln plate?

31:28.350 --> 31:29.200
Is it real?

31:29.680 --> 31:30.280
It's real.

31:32.590 --> 31:33.650
They hired

31:33.680 --> 31:34.830
experts from the National Museum

31:34.830 --> 31:35.690
to appraise it.

31:36.590 --> 31:37.190
Oh, right,

31:37.880 --> 31:39.330
this was even on the news.

31:39.440 --> 31:39.830
Look.

31:40.350 --> 31:40.790
Here.

31:44.640 --> 31:45.100
This...

31:45.240 --> 31:46.970
Is it currently in the country?

31:47.750 --> 31:48.580
Yes, it is.

31:50.440 --> 31:51.370
How did it get in?

31:52.110 --> 31:53.210
This friend of mine

31:53.270 --> 31:54.440
specializes in helping others

31:54.440 --> 31:56.000
transfer assets overseas.

31:56.440 --> 31:57.110
He takes this plate abroad

31:57.110 --> 31:58.600
to auction it,

31:58.830 --> 31:59.790
and someone here

31:59.830 --> 32:01.790
buys it for 200 million.

32:02.240 --> 32:03.170
That 200 million

32:03.310 --> 32:04.880
then leaves the country in a "legal" way,

32:04.880 --> 32:05.590
and the plate

32:05.590 --> 32:07.120
comes in "legally" as well.

32:07.350 --> 32:08.480
But this is money laundering.

32:08.480 --> 32:09.480
The plate wasn't really sold.

32:09.480 --> 32:10.310
It's still his.

32:10.310 --> 32:12.110
So he's in a hurry to find a buyer.

32:12.640 --> 32:13.740
Why am I telling you this?

32:13.740 --> 32:15.020
I'm getting off topic.

32:15.440 --> 32:16.030
For the reflective film,

32:16.030 --> 32:17.690
should we use black or silver?

32:18.030 --> 32:18.960
I want the plate.

32:21.710 --> 32:23.070
I don't want the chime bells anymore.

32:23.070 --> 32:24.470
I want this Ru kiln plate.

32:25.830 --> 32:26.990
Mr. Fang, you...

32:27.090 --> 32:28.070
you...

32:28.240 --> 32:29.890
We already agreed on this.

32:29.920 --> 32:30.380
Well...

32:31.440 --> 32:32.880
You don't want East New Town anymore?

32:32.880 --> 32:33.510
Yes.

32:35.550 --> 32:36.280
Understood.

32:37.240 --> 32:37.750
Then,

32:39.160 --> 32:40.420
the Ru kiln plate it is.

32:41.680 --> 32:43.940
And get a red sandalwood box
to go with it.

32:47.880 --> 32:48.500
Okay.

32:54.750 --> 32:55.350
Uncle Fei,

32:56.240 --> 32:57.300
please help me out.

32:57.680 --> 32:58.440
In all of China,

32:58.440 --> 32:58.750
no,

32:59.000 --> 32:59.930
the whole world,

33:00.240 --> 33:01.750
is there anything you can't get?

33:01.750 --> 33:02.480
I can't help.

33:03.200 --> 33:03.880
This set of chime bells

33:03.880 --> 33:06.000
was fixated on you for a while.

33:07.350 --> 33:08.810
Is there a special reason?

33:08.830 --> 33:10.160
That's the boss's idea.

33:10.400 --> 33:11.800
He wants the chime bells.

33:21.480 --> 33:22.280
I want a plate.

33:24.000 --> 33:24.600
The plate!

33:24.920 --> 33:26.050
He wants a plate now!

33:27.510 --> 33:28.470
Okay.

33:28.590 --> 33:29.200
Then,

33:30.270 --> 33:31.800
let's talk about the price.

33:34.830 --> 33:35.760
Uncle Fei, look,

33:37.960 --> 33:39.590
how about five million?

33:39.790 --> 33:41.110
Zhengzheng, see him out.

33:41.110 --> 33:42.400
Don't.

33:42.480 --> 33:43.180
I don't know the market.

33:43.180 --> 33:44.510
I don't know the market.

33:44.790 --> 33:46.720
Why don't you name a price instead?

33:47.790 --> 33:49.320
At the last Ru kiln auction,

33:50.310 --> 33:51.030
that item

33:51.920 --> 33:53.180
was smaller than mine.

33:54.030 --> 33:54.680
It sold for

33:57.240 --> 33:57.970
300 million.

33:58.960 --> 34:00.030
Thr...

34:00.160 --> 34:01.830
300 million?

34:03.510 --> 34:04.440
I'm doomed.

34:05.000 --> 34:06.270
I'm completely doomed.

34:06.270 --> 34:07.170
I'm doomed.

34:07.440 --> 34:08.719
I'm doomed, Uncle Fei.

34:08.800 --> 34:09.960
My budget is really

34:10.000 --> 34:11.150
far off from yours.

34:11.400 --> 34:12.630
Let me tell you the truth.

34:12.630 --> 34:13.230
If this deal

34:13.230 --> 34:14.330
falls through,

34:14.550 --> 34:16.699
my boss definitely won't let me off.

34:16.760 --> 34:17.760
I'll lose my life!

34:17.760 --> 34:18.190
Don't.

34:18.190 --> 34:19.190
-He'll kill me.
-Don't.

34:19.190 --> 34:19.920
Don't cry.

34:20.030 --> 34:20.670
Our budget

34:20.670 --> 34:22.000
is too far from your price.

34:22.000 --> 34:22.710
Actually...

34:22.710 --> 34:23.840
You can bargain.

34:23.920 --> 34:24.630
What is the maximum

34:24.630 --> 34:26.070
your boss can offer?

34:28.060 --> 34:29.900
The most he can give

34:30.590 --> 34:31.400
is 20 million.

34:36.920 --> 34:37.770
Deal!

34:42.000 --> 34:42.460
This...

34:43.880 --> 34:44.760
It's a deal?

34:52.630 --> 34:53.320
Hello, Ren.

34:53.670 --> 34:55.000
I'm bringing the money now.

34:55.000 --> 34:56.440
Take a good look at the item.

34:56.440 --> 34:56.960
Don't spend 20 million

34:56.960 --> 34:58.150
to buy a fake plate.

34:58.320 --> 34:59.110
Understood.

35:24.590 --> 35:25.400
Don't move!

35:29.670 --> 35:30.150
What's wrong?

35:30.150 --> 35:32.190
You're pissing me off, you know?

35:32.320 --> 35:34.710
The biggest taboo when inspecting goods
is passing them hand to hand.

35:34.710 --> 35:35.710
If you don't hold it well,

35:35.710 --> 35:36.400
and he doesn't catch it,

35:36.400 --> 35:37.920
who is to blame if it breaks?

35:37.920 --> 35:38.920
Whose fault is it?

35:39.150 --> 35:41.280
Put it down first.

35:41.760 --> 35:42.190
Gently.

35:42.190 --> 35:43.190
Put it down.

35:43.360 --> 35:45.550
You're really pissing me off.

35:51.880 --> 35:52.800
You want to see it?

35:52.800 --> 35:53.760
Sure,

35:54.400 --> 35:56.060
but no hand-to-hand passing.

35:56.230 --> 35:57.480
After it's put down,

35:59.030 --> 36:01.070
pick it up yourself,

36:01.360 --> 36:02.670
look at it slowly,

36:03.590 --> 36:05.050
and appreciate it slowly.

36:05.440 --> 36:06.150
Then,

36:07.230 --> 36:09.030
if I hand it to you, don't take it.

36:09.070 --> 36:10.400
I have to put it down,

36:10.840 --> 36:12.400
and you pick it up yourself.

36:13.110 --> 36:13.760
Understand?

36:13.760 --> 36:15.510
Understood.

36:36.550 --> 36:37.000
Uncle.

36:42.320 --> 36:42.880
Ren,

36:43.800 --> 36:45.260
it really wasn't my fault.

36:45.400 --> 36:46.280
If I had broken it,

36:46.280 --> 36:47.610
could I have walked out?

36:47.710 --> 36:48.910
Fang Yong has agreed.

36:49.230 --> 36:50.320
Mr. Rong is also rushing us.

36:50.320 --> 36:51.980
What are we going to give them?

36:52.710 --> 36:53.440
Zhu Yifei said

36:53.440 --> 36:54.670
he has other items.

36:55.030 --> 36:55.960
That 20 million deal

36:55.960 --> 36:57.420
still has to go through us—

36:57.800 --> 37:00.000
otherwise they really won't let me out.

37:11.480 --> 37:11.960
Uncle,

37:12.630 --> 37:14.840
the plate is already glued back together.

37:14.840 --> 37:16.110
If worse comes to worst,

37:16.110 --> 37:17.050
let's find a fool

37:17.150 --> 37:18.610
and sell it to him cheaper.

37:20.710 --> 37:21.670
Call someone

37:21.670 --> 37:22.550
right away.

37:23.960 --> 37:25.090
Tell him to come here

37:25.110 --> 37:25.960
right now.

37:27.030 --> 37:28.000
I heard

37:28.480 --> 37:29.230
he has a set

37:30.030 --> 37:31.840
of Han Dynasty chime bells.

37:33.550 --> 37:34.030
Who?

37:34.880 --> 37:35.670
Liu Bei.

37:47.890 --> 37:50.890
[Liu Bei — tomb raider]

37:48.400 --> 37:49.320
Thanks, Uncle.

37:53.230 --> 37:53.920
Bei,

37:55.760 --> 37:56.800
I heard

37:57.360 --> 37:58.880
you dug up some treasure.

38:03.150 --> 38:03.880
Chime bells?

38:07.960 --> 38:09.320
And it's a complete set.

38:09.670 --> 38:10.530
A complete set.

38:11.230 --> 38:12.070
A set of 9.

38:14.360 --> 38:15.320
It's too risky,

38:16.480 --> 38:17.590
not easy to sell.

38:18.190 --> 38:19.000
I know.

38:20.230 --> 38:22.490
I've been holding onto it for half a year.

38:26.440 --> 38:27.000
Uncle,

38:27.670 --> 38:29.470
give me a chance to make a living.

38:35.710 --> 38:36.360
Alright.

38:37.400 --> 38:37.960
Bei,

38:38.590 --> 38:40.850
just because of your handsome face,

38:41.110 --> 38:43.360
I'll figure something out.

38:45.480 --> 38:47.840
But the goods must be authentic.

38:48.030 --> 38:49.760
I'll go get it for you right now.

38:52.510 --> 38:52.920
Uncle.

38:54.360 --> 38:55.160
So impatient.

38:55.230 --> 38:56.030
What is it now?

38:57.670 --> 38:58.990
Lu Yibo just called,

38:59.360 --> 38:59.920
asking what else

38:59.920 --> 39:00.780
we have on hand.

39:00.920 --> 39:01.920
Anything will do.

39:02.150 --> 39:03.290
Tell him

39:03.800 --> 39:05.150
we have the chime bells he wants.

39:05.150 --> 39:06.320
But

39:06.590 --> 39:07.960
the price is a bit steep.

39:08.480 --> 39:08.920
Wait.

39:09.550 --> 39:11.190
How much does that bastard Liu Bei want?

39:11.190 --> 39:12.670
We haven't negotiated yet.

39:12.670 --> 39:14.330
No matter how much he asks for,

39:14.590 --> 39:17.070
I plan to sell it for 43 million

39:17.280 --> 39:18.230
to Zhou Rong.

39:18.800 --> 39:19.430
How much?

39:19.800 --> 39:21.280
You think I want to?

39:21.880 --> 39:23.740
The plate was broken for nothing?

39:24.760 --> 39:26.190
I'm going to sell it to him for double.

39:26.190 --> 39:27.450
Isn't double

39:27.670 --> 39:29.240
only 40 million?

39:29.550 --> 39:30.760
There's also the brothers' share.

39:30.760 --> 39:32.110
They can't work for free.

39:32.110 --> 39:33.800
Do you have any compassion?

39:39.550 --> 39:41.230
You always think of everything, Uncle.
